{"id":16697,"date":"2026-03-31T11:08:00","date_gmt":"2026-03-31T15:08:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/?p=16697"},"modified":"2026-03-31T09:07:35","modified_gmt":"2026-03-31T13:07:35","slug":"optimist-vs-pessimist-maps","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/optimist-vs-pessimist-maps\/","title":{"rendered":"Optimist vs. Pessimist Maps"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Years ago, my friend <a href=\"https:\/\/freshspectrum.com\/\">Chris Lysy<\/a> made this cartoon about optimist and pessimist charts:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/Chris-Lysy_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Chart.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/Chris-Lysy_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Chart.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16701\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/Chris-Lysy_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Chart.jpg 640w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/Chris-Lysy_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Chart-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/Chris-Lysy_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Chart-600x450.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last week, I applied the optimist vs. pessimist style to a map during <a href=\"https:\/\/courses.depictdatastudio.com\/p\/office-hours-2026\">Office Hours<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">(The real version of the map was about a different topic in a different state, but you get the idea.)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Traditional Map<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I&#8217;ve written about <a href=\"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/are-viewers-expecting-a-story-lightning-talk-from-the-datacated-expo\/\">traditional and storytelling approaches<\/a> before. You&#8217;re probably familiar with this terminology already? <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The traditional version would have a <strong>topical title<\/strong> and <strong>regular ol&#8217; <a href=\"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/more-than-looking-pretty-matching-graph-colors-to-branding\/\">brand colors<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"711\" height=\"757\" src=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16698\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1.png 711w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1-282x300.png 282w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1-600x639.png 600w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_1-300x319.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 711px) 100vw, 711px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Storytelling Map: Optimist Version<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this optimist version, we&#8217;ve got a:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>&#8220;good&#8221; takeaway title;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;good&#8221; brand color;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;good&#8221; <a href=\"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/tag\/icons\/\">icon<\/a>; and a<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>call-out box highlighting a superstar.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"711\" height=\"757\" src=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16699\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2.png 711w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2-282x300.png 282w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2-600x639.png 600w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_2-300x319.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 711px) 100vw, 711px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Storytelling Map: Pessimist Version<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this pessimist version, we&#8217;ve got a:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>&#8220;bad&#8221; takeaway title;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;bad&#8221; brand color;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;bad&#8221; icon; and a<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>call-out box highlighting a laggard.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"711\" height=\"757\" src=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16700\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3.png 711w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3-282x300.png 282w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3-600x639.png 600w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_3-300x319.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 711px) 100vw, 711px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Which Version Should You Use?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That obviously depends on your audience and context.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;re welcome to comment here with your own insights. I read every response.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1140\" src=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16702\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4.png 1920w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4-300x178.png 300w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4-1024x608.png 1024w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4-768x456.png 768w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4-1536x912.png 1536w, https:\/\/ffscdn.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\/depictdatastudio.com\/2026\/03\/AnnKEmery_Optimist-vs-Pessimist-Map_4-600x356.png 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Download These Maps<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want the Excel file that I used to create these maps? You can <a href=\"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.kit.com\/products\/optimist-vs-pessimist-map\">download it here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Colors have a tone and personality. Use them intentionally.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":35,"featured_media":16702,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"wds_primary_category":14,"footnotes":""},"categories":[14],"tags":[199,57],"class_list":["post-16697","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-data-visualization","tag-geographic-maps","tag-storytelling"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16697","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/35"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/depictdatastudio.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=16697"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/